{
  "id": "Lyo.Recipe.Client",
  "name": "Lyo.Recipe.Client",
  "area": "Apps",
  "tagline": "Typed HTTP client for extra Recipe routes.",
  "description": "`IRecipeClient` wraps ingredient-line and step GET/PUT, nested notes/tags, and multipart attachment upload. Category, ingredient, recipe, and attachment CRUD stay on `IApiClient`. Register with `AddRecipeClient<TApiClient>` or a factory overload. `RecipeClientOptions.RoutePrefix` is a path prefix, not an absolute URL.",
  "features": [
    "`ReplaceIngredientLinesAsync` / `ReplaceStepsAsync` PUT the nested collection routes and round-trip row ids.",
    "`ListUnitsAsync` / `SaveUnitAsync` use `Recipe/Units`. `ListIngredientUsageAsync` GETs `Recipe/Ingredients/{id}/Usage`.",
    "`AddNoteAsync` / `AddTagAsync` take a parent route (`Recipe/Recipes`, `Recipe/Ingredients`, or `Recipe/Categories`).",
    "`UploadAttachmentAsync` posts `Recipe/Attachments/upload` with extra form fields and no content-type restriction."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register on an existing IApiClient",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddRecipeClient<ApiClient>();\nvar lines = await recipe.ReplaceIngredientLinesAsync(recipeId, lines);"
    }
  ],
